    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuyika kwa Msimu Ŵaswela",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pilyakwanile lisiku lya kusangalalila cindimba ca Pentekosite,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ŵakulupilila wosope ŵaliji pampepe m'nyumba jimo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.23.15+LEV.23.16+LEV.23.17+LEV.23.18+LEV.23.19+LEV.23.20+LEV.23.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lef 23:15-21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.16.9+DEU.16.10+DEU.16.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Det 16:9-11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwacisisimucisya kwapikanice lisegwe kutyocela kwinani mpela mkokomo wa mbungo jamacili ni jagumbele m'nyumba mosope mwele muŵaliji mkutama mula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nipo ŵagaweni malulumi mpela malamba ga moto gali mgaŵanyika, ni gagwilaga pa jwalijose jwa jemanjajo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wosope ŵala ŵapocele Msimu Ŵaswela ni ŵatandite kuŵeceta yiŵeceto ya cilendo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " mpela yiŵatite Msimuwo pakwaŵecetekasya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu Yelusalemu mula mwapali Ayuda ŵane, ŵandu ŵiŵaliji kumlumba Mlungu ŵakutyocela myilambo yakulekanganalekangana pa cilambo cosope capasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piŵapikene cimkokomo cila, likuga lya ŵandu ŵajinji lyasongene ni lyatojime ligongo jwalijose jwapikene ŵakulupililawo ali mkuŵeceta ciŵeceto cakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵasimonjile kwakumasya lunda acitiji, “Ana ŵandu wosope ŵakuŵecetaŵa ngaŵa ŵakutyocela ku Galileya? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambi uli jwalijose jwetuwe akwapikana ali mkuŵeceta ciŵeceto ciŵapagwile naco? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwe tukutyocela ku yilambo ya Apati, Amedi ni Elamu, ŵane akutama ku Mesopotamiya, ku Yudeya ni ku Kapadokiya, ku Pontasi ni ku Asiya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ku Filijiya ni Pamfiliya, ku Iguputo, ni mbali sya ku Libiya kwakuŵandikana ni ku Kilene. Ŵane ni acalendo ŵakutyocela ku Loma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayuda ni ŵandu ŵane ŵiŵakuyaga ya dini ja Ciyuda, nipo ŵane ŵa uwe tukutyocela ku Kilete ni kwa Alebiya, nambope wosopewe tukwapikana alimkuŵeceta myiŵeceto yetu kwamba ya masengo gamakulungwa gatesile Mlungu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wosope ŵasimonjile ni lwamalile lunda, ni ŵawusyene kuti, “Ana yeleyi ni yicici?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo ŵane ŵagambaga kuseka acitiji, “Akolelwe finyo jwasambano.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Utenga wa Petulo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaneko Petulo",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ŵajimi pampepe ni ŵandumetume likumi ni jumo, nipo Petulo ŵaŵecete mwakwesya maloŵe kuti: “Jemanja Ayuda, ni wosope ŵamkutama ku Yelusalemu kuno, mpikane ni kupikanicisya maloŵe gangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu aŵa nganakolelwa mpela yimkuti pakuganisya, pakuti ndaŵi jili 9 koloko ja kundaŵi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo yeleyi ni yiŵaŵecete jwakulocesya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Yoweli kuti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Jemanja Aisalaeli, mpikanile maloŵe aga. Yesu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " jwa ku Nasaleti ŵaliji mundu jwele juŵamtumile Mlungu kwa jemanja. Mlungu ŵamsimicisye yeleyi ya macili, yakusimonjesya ni yimanyisyo yiŵapanganyisye mwa Yesu pasikati penu, mpela yimkuti pakumanyilila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sambano Yesujo ŵapelecedwe mwakusosa ni kumanyilila kwakwe Mlungu, m'makono genu. Ni jemanja mwamwuleje pakumpeleka kwa ŵandu ŵakusakala kuti amkomele pa msalaba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
